+start index of i will be the element at i, then end index of i will be the element
+at i+1. That is:
+
+```prettyprint
+indices = [0,5,11,115]
+
+is equivalent to
+
+indices = [ [0,5],
+            [5,11],
+            [11,115]]
+```
+
+data: The source of data where the computation will be taken from.
